the ring stays whole until the water plane reaches a bottom corner when tilting towards an edge: 7 d^2 - 6 d + 1 = 0, d = (3 - sqrt 2)/7 = 0.226541
tilting towards a face it would reach the bottom edge only at tan = 2 d: 12 d (1 - d) - 2 = 4 d^2, d = 0.2500
